#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:27
msgid "Required Group"
msgstr "Required Group"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:28
msgid ""
"The Okta group that users must be in to have access. If left empty, all "
"Okta users who can authenticate will be allowed to log in and a local "
"user account will be created automatically. It is strongly recommended to"
" set this field in enterprise environments to restrict access to "
"authorized users only."
msgstr "El grupo de Okta en el que deben estar los usuarios para tener acceso. Si se deja vacío, todos los usuarios de Okta que puedan autenticarse podrán iniciar sesión y se creará automáticamente una cuenta de usuario local. Se recomienda encarecidamente configurar este campo en entornos empresariales para restringir el acceso solo a usuarios autorizados."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:29
msgid "Default Role"
msgstr "Default Role"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:30
msgid ""
"The default role applied to all users who pass the Required Group check. "
"This role is always assigned in addition to any roles granted through "
"role mappings below."
msgstr "El rol predeterminado aplicado a todos los usuarios que pasan la verificación del grupo requerido. Este rol siempre se asigna además de cualquier rol otorgado mediante las asignaciones de roles siguientes."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:31
msgid "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"
msgstr "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:32
msgid ""
"When selected, Tenant users with appropriate rights to view and edit "
"Roles will have the ability to set role mapping for the Identity Source "
"integration. This allows the Tenant user to edit only the role mappings "
"without viewing or potentially editing the Identity Source configuration."
msgstr ""
"When seleccionado, Tenant users con apropiado rights to view y edit Roles"
" será tienen el ability to set role mapping para el Identity Source "
"integration. This allows el Tenant user to edit solo el rol mappings sin "
"viewing o potentially editing el Identity Source configuración."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:33
msgid "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"
msgstr "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:34
msgid ""
"When selected, administrators can manually edit Roles for users created "
"through this identity source integration from the user detail page "
"(|AdmUse| > Selected user)."
msgstr ""
"When seleccionado, administrators puede manualmente edit Roles para users"
" creado a través de este fuente de identidad integration desde el usuario"
" página de detalles (|AdmUse| > Selected user)."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:36
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:42
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:36
msgid ""
"For more on Identity Source role mapping permissions, see the `associated"
" guide <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-"
"Subtenant-admins-to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ "
"in our KnowledgeBase."
msgstr ""
"For más on Identity Source role mapping permisos, see el `associated "
"guide <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-"
"Subtenant-admins-to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ "
"in our KnowledgeBase."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:38
msgid ""
"Now, allowed Okta users can log into |morpheus| via their Okta "
"credentials and a user will be automatically generated within |morpheus| "
"with matching metadata and mapped Role permissions."
msgstr ""
"Now, allowed Okta users puede log en |morpheus| via their Okta "
"credentials y un usuario será be automáticamente generated dentro de "
"|morpheus| con matching metadata y mapped Role permisos."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:40
msgid ""
"For Okta applications using the SAML SSO identity-source type, each "
"configured Role mapping is compared with one complete SAML attribute "
"value. Comma- or space-separated role names inside a single value are not"
" parsed. Emit the group/role attribute as a multi-value SAML attribute, "
"with one exact value for each desired mapping. This limitation applies to"
" SAML attribute mapping; it does not mean that every Okta identity-source"
" mapping mechanism is limited to one Role."
msgstr "Para aplicaciones de Okta que utilizan el tipo de fuente de identidad SAML SSO, cada asignación de rol configurada se compara con un valor de atributo SAML completo. Los nombres de roles separados por comas o espacios dentro de un solo valor no se analizan. Emita el atributo de grupo/rol como un atributo SAML multivalor, con un valor exacto para cada asignación deseada. Esta limitación se aplica a la asignación de atributos SAML; no significa que todo mecanismo de asignación de fuentes de identidad de Okta esté limitado a un rol."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/okta.rst:42
msgid ""
"If you've created multi-tenant roles, these will also appear here and can"
" be mapped to Okta user groups allowing you to map users to equivalent "
"user groups in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"If you've creado multi-tenant roles, estos será también appear aquí y "
"puede be mapped to Okta user groups allowing you to map users to "
"equivalent user groups in |morpheus|."

